## Environment Configs

### `dev.tfvars`

```hcl
environment            = "dev"
region                 = "us-east-1"
bucket_name            = "canonical-dev-assets"
enable_replication     = false

db_instance_class   = "db.t3.micro"
db_multi_az         = false
db_backup_retention = 7

subnet_ids             = ["subnet-dev-a", "subnet-dev-b"]
vpc_security_group_ids = ["sg-dev-rds"]

sops_secrets_file = "secrets.dev.enc.yaml"
```

### `prod.tfvars`

```hcl
environment            = "prod"
region                 = "us-east-1"
bucket_name            = "canonical-prod-assets"
